  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Stay cool, dry, and mission-ready with Rothco&rsquo;s Quick Dry Moisture Wicking T-Shirt. Made from 100% performance polyester, this high-performance shirt rapidly pulls sweat away from your skin and dries fast to prevent cling and discomfort. Designed for action with reinforced seams and a tag-less label, this military crewneck tee offers a standard fit ideal for training, tactical work, or everyday wear&mdash;making it the ultimate moisture wicking workout shirt.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "5278",
  "description": "<p>Stay cool, dry, and mission-ready with Rothco&rsquo;s Quick Dry Moisture Wicking T-Shirt. Made from 100% performance polyester, this high-performance shirt rapidly pulls sweat away from your skin and dries fast to prevent cling and discomfort. Designed for action with reinforced seams and a tag-less label, this military crewneck tee offers a standard fit ideal for training, tactical work, or everyday wear&mdash;making it the ultimate moisture wicking workout shirt. Advanced Moisture Wicking: Engineered with 100% performance polyester, the Quick Dry Moisture Wicking T-Shirt wicks sweat and wetness away for optimum comfort. Featuring our rapid moisture control fabric, sweat is swiftly transferred to the top layer, allowing for a quick dry. This prevents sweat from soaking through these gym shirts so that they won&rsquo;t stick to your skin. Action Ready: These military crewneck tees consist of reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem to further enhance the gym shirt&rsquo;s durability. With a tag-less neck label, you&rsquo;re free to move around without any itches or scratches. Standard Fit: These rugged base layer t-shirts are standard fit, giving you room and flexibility for various activities, especially around the arms. Our short sleeve t-shirts sit approximately at the waist for full coverage. Built for Performance: Whether you're on duty, at the gym, or hitting the trail, this moisture wicking workout shirt is designed for high-intensity training, outdoor work, and tactical operations, delivering unbeatable comfort and quick-dry performance when you need it most. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Pair your short sleeve tee with one of our Tactical BDU Cargo Pants or Vintage Paratrooper Cargo Shorts.</p>",
